  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Growing up on the mean streets of Brokeland, 'Bubblegum' Benny learned early that survival meant taking what you could get. Abandoned by his flock when he was just a hatchling, Benny honed his skills scavenging for scraps and DRIP in the ruins of Old Subchain City, becoming a master of disguise and deception.",
    "class": "Scout/Infiltrator",
    "name": "'Bubblegum' Benny",
    "personality": "Cynical, resourceful, and surprisingly sentimental. Benny puts on a tough exterior, chewing bubblegum and cracking wise, but deep down he yearns for the belonging he lost. He's fiercely loyal to those who earn his trust, which is a difficult feat.",
