      "description": "Benny blows a massive bubblegum bubble infused with a temporary glitch in the blockchain, creating a localized distortion field that briefly renders him invisible and undetectable to enemy systems. He can then use this opportunity to sneak past enemy lines, sabotage equipment, or make a quick escape.",
